| `make fe-install` `[tree,read]` | Installs each frontend app's npm dependencies, after `scripts/check_toolchain.py node` has refused a Node whose major is not the configured one, so each lockfile is installed under the runtime that resolved it; with `install_sources.npm_registry` set, each `npm install` takes it as `--registry`, and null leaves the user's own `.npmrc`. | `make fe-install` | [`FE_APPS`](settings.md#make-variables), [`toolchain.node_major`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`install_sources.npm_registry`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`scripts/check_toolchain.py mode`](settings.md#command-line-flags), [`scripts/install_sources.py source`](settings.md#command-line-flags) | Reads the network; its dependencies are outside the child-process allowlist. The Node check compares the major only. | [limits-and-troubleshooting.md](../guides/limits-and-troubleshooting.md) | always |
